<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\店出入り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "3000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> and I were at Zahha for the second time; <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> for the third.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There were as many high school students as ever.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could hear whispering.<PG>
"Hey, hey, they say the one who died today was <STYLE ID="3">that girl's dad</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"For real!? He died today and she's out at Zahha?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"And on top of that, they say that <STYLE ID="1">third-year</STYLE> got questioned as the culprit."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Word travels fast among high school students.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> seemed to be conscious of the eyes around her.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you don't have to mind them."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, in truth this was certainly no time for me to be sitting in Zahha like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As soon as <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> finished talking, I had to call the relatives and the funeral home.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpaaai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "五島.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
The instant she sat down, <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> called out brightly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, hey, is this one your treat as well!?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"A-Are you an idiot! I've already used up today's budget!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Aww, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you're so cheeeap!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Are you an idiot! You </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">hyena</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"And just whooo is a hyena!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Saying that to the genius </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">beautiful</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> girl acknowledged by myself and everyone else, Erina Goto!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Since when are you a </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">beautiful</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Now, now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's right, when the three of us get together, this is more or less how it turns out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had missed this feeling so much.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Wahahahaha! I am the one who cast the curse. So the culprit is me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Y-you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...! Don't go poking at such a touchy spot!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm in my third year of high school and I've still got chunibyo."</STYLE> [TN: chunibyo = the middle-school delusions-of-grandeur phase]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭抱える.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Nnngh! Damn... at this point it's completely my dark history..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯バイブ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ赤入.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"............?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
It seemed a text message had arrived from someone I did not know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A spam message, perhaps.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="6">“This is Ise of Motoki Police Station. You've been through a lot today. There's something I wasn't able to tell you earlier, so, somewhere </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> can't hear, call this number right away.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
What... does this mean...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I sent <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> a look at once.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, never mind that, what I really want to say is―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> seemed to have caught on at once, and stopped her blatant teasing of <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\椅子から立つ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Aaaaaaah!!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suddenly <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> stood up and screamed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"What's wrong, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The tense air was back between us again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花座り込み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah... ahh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s whole body was shaking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯バイブ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2,000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I knew it...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This time it seemed to be <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s smartphone ringing.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき電話.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hello!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Yes... yes... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'll be right there!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"My bad, you two! The talk's gonna have to wait!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"What on earth is going on!?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"You two forgot!?</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">　I ordered a same-day pizza delivery at Motoki Station, didn't I!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Sorry! I'll be right back!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\店出入り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "700" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Japan's number one pizza idiot</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, isn't she..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"If we can't hear what </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> has to say, there's nothing for it... shall we head out too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'll send </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> a message saying we're heading back..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2,000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "600" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マンション前夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The sun had gone down completely.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>'s bicycle was apparently still left with the police, so for the time being I had her come along with me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Come to think of it, I left my bicycle in front of the station too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"If you tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mister</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, it'll be fine. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Also, there's going to be a lot to get ready from here on, isn't there?</STYLE> <STYLE ID="2">I'll help too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah... thank you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Not at all. I owe </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> more than I could ever repay!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"There you go exaggerating again..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"It is not an exaggeration at all. What I am now, I owe to </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> says this sort of thing at every opportunity.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Now then, what is it I should do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Then, could you look for the relatives' address book? I think it's in one of the shelves somewhere."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Understood!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Maybe I should look up how a funeral is done.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hmm... but in a case like this, does the Buddhist sect have something to do with it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
