<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you had a message come in earlier, didn't you? Something you can't say in front of </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
