<STYLE ID="12">To </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Akane</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">As of this moment, </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="しよう">Shiyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> 800, April 6, 23:00.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">The reason I am writing this out on paper instead of sending mail is to leave no evidence of any kind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">On the night of Shiyo 800, April 7, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="12">that is, tomorrow,</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "忍び寄る影.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="12">I have decided to meet </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Mifuyu-san </STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="12">I will negotiate the matter in question.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">, I am sorry for this, but as far as possible, in front of </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> make a point of behaving exactly as always.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="12">It goes without saying, but if this comes out, </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> will not be able to live in society any longer.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">All of it is for the two of them. </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> above all must never be allowed to know.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="12">And </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">, we have no choice but to let her live believing in the curse.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">If we do not, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> too will be erased from society.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> have been told already, but be very careful about </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">'s cell phone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">There is no telling what may be in this house either.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">As far as possible, live exactly as always.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="12">Trust me and wait. By the morning of April 8, it should all be over.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="14">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> is no fool either. She will not lay a hand on our family.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">In exchange, </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">'s true identity cannot be made public either.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="12">But if the worst should happen, on April 8, whatever occurs, do not leave </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> alone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> end up unable to move, have her spend it with </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">, just the two of them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">If you arrange for her to stay on at the police station with no reason to, the police may find it suspicious.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> must not find out; be careful.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">I am counting on you.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">Ryoji Kogori</STYLE><PG>
